# Step-by-step instructions

When Paul needs to do something outside the code, write every action in order.
Do not assume he knows the product, the screen, or what a shorthand refers to.

- Name the exact site, project, service, tab, and button.
- One action per numbered step. Say what to click, what to type, and what the result should look like.
- If a value comes from another Railway service, show the full `${{Service.VARIABLE}}` text and where to type it. Do not say only "from the other service".
- Define a term the first time it appears, in the same step that uses it.
- Include the success check and the most likely wrong result.
